To watch MuJoCo from your local machine: run `ssh -L 8080:localhost:8080 USER@HOST` (replace USER and HOST with your remote login and hostname) to forward local port 8080 to the remote viewer. Run `uv run play ... --viewer viser --num-envs 1` in the remote quack folder, then open http://localhost:8080 on your local machine. Keep SSH open; the NVIDIA machine runs the simulation and your browser shows the viewer.
